{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_33654","headline":"寒女行 · 邵谒","name":"寒女行","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"寒女命自薄，生来多贱微。\n家贫人不聘，一身无所归。\n养蚕多苦心，茧熟他人丝。\n织素徒苦力，素成他人衣。\n青楼富家女，才生便有主。\n终日着罗绮，何曾识机杼。\n清夜闻歌声，听之泪如雨。\n他人如何欢，我意又何苦。\n所以问皇天，皇天竟无语。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"邵谒","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_33654.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_33654","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"乐府","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}